# Deny first, then allow: a file added to the repo later cannot reach a layer
# without being named here.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/

# Redundant against the allowlist above, kept so widening it stays safe.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
